## Interface: 16001
## Title: HandkerSheaf
## Notes: Never set off without it. Sort your Objective Tracker by level or distance, stack nearby (?) and (•••) quests into card decks, filter by rewards or levels, and keep a handwritten Field Tally of the quest items left to gather and tasks left to do (hover for map reference), and enter your own tasks and notes with a dedicated journal page that you can record your journey in. /hanky
